    not_duplicate_of: []  # 535a
    pr_ref:  # 535a
    description: "Found by the 2026-10-20 docstring-staleness audit (verifier reproduced). starlark.py ~L325 builds `dst=f\"starlark:{ctx.rel_path}:{dep}\"` from the raw deps label, which never equals a target Symbol id (`starlark:<path>:<s>-<e>:<name>:target`), even for a same-package `\":lib\"` dep. `target_ids` is written (~L316) and passed along (~L490/518/546) but never read; no linker rewrites starlark depends_on dsts. So every depends_on edge dangles. Fix: resolve `:name` (and `//pkg:name` when the BUILD file is in the repo) through target_ids. Docstring \"Dependency edges between targets\" left stating the intent."  # 535a
    fields: {}  # 535a
