  message: "Closed (owner-approved, root-cause sweep 2026-11-01 (dev b27eb0e0d0; lab ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/tracker_hygiene_sweep_2026-11-01T223538Z/)). Fixed by WI-pusan in PR #1833 (dev 9814ac193b). Live repro today on dev b27eb0e0d0, fixture BUILD: cc_library lib + cc_binary app deps [':lib','//pkg:util','@ext//x:y'], pkg/BUILD: cc_library util. analyze_starlark emits depends_on app -> starlark:BUILD:1-1:lib:target and app -> starlark:pkg/BUILD:1-1:util:target, both ids of emitted target symbols; the external @ext//x:y stays an unresolved dst, which is correct. Residual noted, not filed: target_ids is still written and nothing reads it."  # 8a59
